    "detailed_description": "In the boundless deep blue, sea snakes are locked in an eternal submerged battle to claim the throne of  ocean overlords.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLive your best sea snake life.  Eat voraciously and elongate your body while staying safe from predators. Gobble everything you can except your own growing body.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are many creatures in the deep to snack on, but be careful. The delicious pufferfish sometimes swells up revealing poisonous spines.  If you are eaten, and reduced to a small fry, find a pearl from one of the shells on the sea floor to return to snake form.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDragon balls occasionally appear in shells and will elevate your snake self to Dragon King of the sea, increasing speed and giving strength enough to devour dangerous hermit crabs.",
    "about_the_game": "In the boundless deep blue, sea snakes are locked in an eternal submerged battle to claim the throne of  ocean overlords.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLive your best sea snake life.  Eat voraciously and elongate your body while staying safe from predators. Gobble everything you can except your own growing body.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are many creatures in the deep to snack on, but be careful. The delicious pufferfish sometimes swells up revealing poisonous spines.  If you are eaten, and reduced to a small fry, find a pearl from one of the shells on the sea floor to return to snake form.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDragon balls occasionally appear in shells and will elevate your snake self to Dragon King of the sea, increasing speed and giving strength enough to devour dangerous hermit crabs.",
    "short_description": "Classic snake game with modern rules and infinite exciting. Play alone or with friends to fight against AI. The classic snake game reimagined with modern rules for infinite excitement. Battle the AI alone or with friends to become ruler of the seas.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean",
